<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- The Dhamma.Gift splash mark: the gem of the launcher icon, as a vector in its FINAL state, built from the
     icon's own geometry (an outer and a middle octagon and eight rays from the centre, measured off
     pwa-bold-monocolor-512.png; teal strokes with the icon's thin orange edge). dg_splash_icon.xml animates it:
     a 250 ms still, the gem opens as a circle from its own centre while it turns into place, then a glint
     crosses it (owner, 2026-10-04, on old.dhamma.gift/dict-app/splash-gem.html). 288dp is the canvas the system
     gives a splash icon; the gem is 120dp across, inside the centre 192dp circle. -->
